flowchart LR
  Input[Meeting text or manual notes] --> UI[Product owner document studio]
  Existing[Existing page snapshot] --> Versions[Preserved document versions]
  UI --> RAG[Retrieve and confirm business context]
  Fixtures[Fictional pages and glossary] --> RAG
  RAG --> Draft[Template plus evidence plus previous version]
  Versions --> Draft
  Draft --> SDK[GitHub Copilot SDK]
  SDK --> Runtime[Org approved runtime and model]
  Draft --> Offline[Explicit offline demo]
  Runtime --> Review[Readable draft and human review]
  Offline --> Review
  Review --> Versions
  Review --> Word[Word document]
  Review --> Preview[Local Confluence simulation]
  Future[Future API connector with optional MCP] -.-> RAG
  Review -.-> Publish[Future create or version-checked page update]
